And the API. Where to put it? Near the ADB section or a new section. Let me add a new section after the `/api/adb/info` block — "─── LAUNCHER (local device, no runner) ───".

Storage: a JSON file in hubTmp(): `phone-apps.json`. Content: `{ updatedAt, source, device, apps: [{label,pkg,icon}] }`. Icons are base64 PNG — a few hundred KB total. Cap the payload size (express json limit?). Let me check the express json body limit in server.js.

